<p>BlackRock launched its spot Bitcoin ETF in January 2024 following the US Securities and Exchange Commission's landmark approval. IBIT was the fastest ETF in history to reach $10 billion in assets. Since then, BlackRock has continued accumulating Bitcoin on behalf of institutional and retail clients who use the ETF as their primary vehicle for Bitcoin exposure.</p>

